+# DADAO port (skeleton placeholder)
+
+Placeholder directory for the DADAO-v5 port of Embench-iot.
+
+The board shim (`initialise_board` / `start_trigger` / `stop_trigger`) and the
+minimal freestanding runtime (`mem*` / `str*` / `ctype` / `sqrt`) are added by
+DADAO-v5 task `TESTCASES-039t`.  This file declares no behaviour; it exists only
+so the component patch tree under `components/embench-iot/` is a valid,
+rebuildable skeleton (see `spec/Process-01-组件补丁组织与构建编排.md`).
